---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | AcousticSearch"
  description="Privacy Policy for AcousticSearch IEM Recommendation Engine."
>
  <div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 relative z-10 text-textPrimary">
    <a href="/" className="font-mono text-xs text-textMuted hover:text-accentPrimary uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 inline-block">
      &larr; Back to Search
    </a>
    
    <h1 className="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    
    <p className="font-mono text-xs text-textMuted uppercase mb-8">
      Last Updated: August 11, 2026
    </p>

    <div className="space-y-6 font-body text-textMuted leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        AcousticSearch is a privacy-focused public recommendation tool. We do not require account registration or store personal identity profiles. 
        When you use our search engine, we process free-text sound preference queries to match acoustic targets.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">2. Technical & Analytics Logs</h2>
      <p>
        For security, rate limiting, and system reliability, our API servers record standard request IP addresses, browser User-Agent strings, and endpoint access timestamps. These logs are stored temporarily and automatically rotated.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">3. Third-Party AI & Vector Services</h2>
      <p>
        Natural language queries are translated into target feature vectors using Google Gemini API. Queries sent to the AI model do not contain personally identifiable information (PII).
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">4. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        AcousticSearch uses browser <code className="font-mono text-accentPrimary">sessionStorage</code> solely to preserve your recent search preferences and filter state during your active browsing session. We do not use cross-site tracking cookies or advertising pixels.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us via our official repository or project channels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
